1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,122
There's a hundred
and four days of summer vacation

2
00:00:03,162 --> 00:00:05,723
Then school comes
along just to end it

3
00:00:05,763 --> 00:00:08,765
So the annual
problem for our generation

4
00:00:08,805 --> 00:00:11,767
Is finding a
good way to spend it

5
00:00:12,087 --> 00:00:13,248
Life ain't easy

6
00:00:13,288 --> 00:00:15,529
Building a rocket
or fighting a mummy

7
00:00:15,569 --> 00:00:18,050
You're climbing
up the Eiffel Tower

8
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,053
Discovering
something that doesn't exist

9
00:00:21,093 --> 00:00:23,534
Hey，Giving a
monkey a shower

10
00:00:24,014 --> 00:00:25,256
Surfing
tidal waves

11
00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:26,297
Creating nanobots

12
00:00:26,337 --> 00:00:29,220
Are locating
Frankenstein's brain

13
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,582
Finding a
dodo bird

14
00:00:30,622 --> 00:00:31,743
Painting a
continent

15
00:00:31,783 --> 00:00:33,706
Driving your
sister insane

16
00:00:33,746 --> 00:00:34,667
Flicka

17
00:00:34,707 --> 00:00:35,388
As you can see

18
00:00:35,428 --> 00:00:36,629
There's a
whole lot of stuff

19
00:00:36,669 --> 00:00:38,511
To do before
school starts this fall

20
